{
  "name": "R1 Boots of earth",
  "type": "accessory",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"Traducci&oacute;n\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiTqvTroOuDAxW9FLkGHVHWCfsQ3ewLegQIBRAQ\"><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"en\">[Trigger: Refer] Used when you declare [Wait]. Add +5 to your [Recovery]. This effect lasts until the end of the round. </span></p>\n<hr>\n<p class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"Traducci&oacute;n\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiTqvTroOuDAxW9FLkGHVHWCfsQ3ewLegQIBRAQ\"><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"en\">Boots that absorb the magical power flowing through the earth and transform it into the power of the wearer. If you stop walking, you can receive the life force of the earth, and once you start moving, you can receive the blessings of light steps.</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>Magic cylinder [core material] (30G) +</p>\n<p>leather boots (60G) +</p>\n<p>[magic catalyst 1] (15G) x 3 +</p>\n<p>Crafting Cost (45G)</p>",
